dialogue prologue_vault_door
title: Whatever you are
trigger: Prologue Crawl
speaker commander $commander
speaker knight knight
speaker barbarian barbarian
speaker cleric cleric

node look commander
  Three Moorfolk stand in the broken doorway, slime on their boots and dead Mana Orbs at their belts. All three orbs are glowing.
  -> knight

node knight knight
  I saw the lights come on when you moved. Every lamp in the vault, and then our orbs.
  -> cleric

node cleric cleric
  Nobody has slept in these tanks since Halcyon fell. Nobody was supposed to wake up in one.
  -> barbarian

node barbarian barbarian
  There'll be more slimes on the stair, drawn by the leak. We can talk at the top.
  -> follow

node follow knight
  Whatever you are, our orbs work near you. Come with us.
